H3 prepare source reproduction

prepare.hip is an unchanged copy of the research-vresidual-uniform-v3 source
used by the research-residual-combined release. The reduction helper retains
its vLLM, NVIDIA and SageAttention attribution. See LICENSE (Apache-2.0).

reference/prepare.fatbin is the original prepare GPU code from that release.
The Python test driver and prepare-only binding were added for this package.
